93:- [ ] **3.1** `jetson_clocks` — GPU 1386 -> 1575 MHz, EMC 2750 -> 4266. Measured in-repo at\n595:- [ ] **3.2** Final `PERF.md` re-run and both coefficients recorded. Then STOP and hand back.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0feea41c-4ca3-4994-84ae-be9578be1c75","uuid":"003e2301-a7b7-4b9b-b2fa-d7be1823cff8","timestamp":"2026-08-20T09:35:35.563Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"107:- [x] **0.1** `timings` on `/v1/completions` — staged in `server.cpp`, built 2026-08-19.\n108:- [x] **0.2** `DSV4_DPROF` diff at two contexts. **DONE 2026-08-19.** The headline below — \"the\n129:- [x] **0.3** Re-fit `tools/decode_model.py` on a post-fix run and record both coefficients.\n191:- [x] **0.4** `DSV4_DPROF` at ctx 12k, and attribute the residual 7.36 ms/1000. **DONE\n281:- [x] **1.1** Warp-parallel top-k (all four kernels). **14.2x at ctx 6592, 24.7x at 24k**,\n283:- [x] **1.0** **Cache the DSpark main-KV prefix instead of recomputing it every token.**\n384:- [x] **1.2** **Single-CTA radix select instead of the warp selection sort.**\n471:- [ ] **1.3** `seq_len <= topk` early-out. Below ctx 2048 every row survives and the kernel still\n473:- [ ] **1.4** `cudaFuncSetAttribute` opt-in for dynamic shared memory, or drop the requirement\n483:- [ ] **1.5** **CONFIRMED BY 0.4, 2026-08-20 — this kernel is 9 % of the context term.**\n490:- [ ] **1.9** **Find out why the engine stops reproducing itself part-way through a long run.**\n529:- [ ] **1.7** `cattn:sparse` — **0.709 +/- 0.050 ms per 1000 context (10 % of the term), measured\n536:- [ ] **1.8** **Explain the `cattn:q_proj` bimodality 0.4 found.** At ctx 6144, at the SAME verify\n542:- [x] **1.6** **RESOLVED as pre-existing — proven by a control build, not by argument.**\n562:- [~] **1b.1** Pack the DSA index cache as real MXFP4: 128xE2M1 + 4xUE8M0 = **68 B** (was 512 B).\n577:- [ ] **1b.2** Pack KV dims 0-447 as real FP8 E4M3 + 7xUE8M0 = **711 B** (was 2048 B); RoPE stays\n582:- [ ] **2.1** Re-tune blo