{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CeDo63YF16xsUwHVfWwfV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Run is in flight (6 checkpoint loads, ~2h). Phase 0 already passed. While it runs, here's what's landed so far:\n\n**Implementation** — `include/topk_radix.h`: when `lim <= topk`, every candidate survives by definition, so the MSB-first threshold search is skipped entirely and the gather runs with `thr = 0`. Threaded through all four `_rx` kernels as a launch argument fed by `topk_early_on()` (`DSV4_TOPK_EARLY=0` restores the full search on the same binary).\n\n**Phase 0 unit gate — PASS, both arms, two independent runs:**\n\n| T | topk | fires | full µs (min/med/max) | early µs | saving |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 128 | 128 | yes | 12.30/12.31/12.36 | 10.20/10.20/10.23 | +2.10 |\n| 384 | 384 | yes | 18.37/18.38/18.43 | 14.34/14.34/14.38 | **+4.04** |\n| 512 | 512 | yes | 18.40/18.47/18.73 | 14.34/14.57/14.79 | +3.90 |\n| 1024 | 512 | no | 28.70/28.75/28.80 | 28.70/28.73/28.80 | +0.01 |\n| 3072 | 512 | no | 32.76/32.77/32.79 | 32.76/32.77/32.81 | +0.00 |\n\nThe `T > topk` rows are the built-in negative control: the arm is inert there to within 0.05 µs. Bit-identical to the untouched warp selection sort on all 4 kernel shapes × 6 distributions × 13 lengths, with the early-out both ON and OFF.\n\nI'll report the engine-level result when the run finishes."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1165,"cache_read_input_tokens":147164,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1165},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0feea41c-4ca3-4994-84ae-be9578be1c75","uuid":"886da89c-c485-4da9-975a-11f62ced4027","timestamp":"2026-08-20T09:52:41.151Z","request_id":"req_011CeDo621iRrADq3CL